<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50608" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], ἴᾰ,
		ἰόν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one</i>,
			commonest in fem. (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷς</span>): neut. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰῷ κίον ἤματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.422
				</span></i>
			: masc. dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰῷ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκείνῳ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				8.8
			</span></i>; but, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑνί</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.23
			</span></i>; acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόν γ᾽ ἰὸν
			ἐνιαυτόν</span> the <i>same</i> year, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1390.126
			</span></i> (Andania, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόνος</span>
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Trypho
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				56.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
